# Custom CMS (not Payload)

Octagen uses a first-party admin at `/admin` with Prisma models.

- Do not add Payload config, collections, or `@payloadcms/*`
- Keep admin routes authenticated
- Validate mutations with Zod
- No prices, cart, or customer auth in CMS
- Inquiry SMTP credentials stay in env, never in the database
